('الصف الحادي عشر - زراعي','اللغة الإنجليزية','Unit 1: Learning styles','Learning styles','UNIT
Learning styles
1 Discuss these questions in pairs or small groups.
Which of these ways of studying do you prefer?
▸
making your own written notes
▸
